        "content": [
          "Two Greek suffixes quietly name huge",
          "swathes of English: -ONYM (name) and",
          "-GRAPHY (writing, description).",
          "",
          "You already met pseudonym (false-name)",
          "and biography (life-writing) without",
          "being told the pattern.",
          "",
          "Now you can predict the rest: synonym,",
          "antonym, homonym — same-name,",
          "opposite-name, sound-alike-name.",
          "",
          "cartography, choreography,",
          "photography — map-writing, dance-",
          "writing, light-writing.",
          "",
          "Once you own the suffix, you own",
          "the whole family it names."
        ],
